  <description>
    <p>ArDali Media Player is a Linux desktop media app that combines music playback, video playback, web media, downloading workflows, and advanced DSP controls in a single interface.</p>
    <p>Main features include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Local music and video playback with playlist management</li>
      <li>Advanced audio processing including 32-band EQ, compressor, limiter, reverb, and more</li>
      <li>Song recognition workflow via ArDali Pulse integration</li>
      <li>projectM-based real-time visualizer</li>
      <li>MPRIS integration for desktop media controls</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

